    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence1-8",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_A",
      "source_quote": "大同元年，以例封汝南侯，邑五百戶。",
      "reading": "大同元年按例封汝南侯，食邑五百戶。",
      "note": "大同元年按例封汝南侯，食邑五百戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 8,
      "end_codepoint": 25,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence1-25",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_A",
      "source_quote": "亦善草隸，性頗庸短。",
      "reading": "傳評其能草隸而性庸短。",
      "note": "傳評其能草隸而性庸短。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 25,
      "end_codepoint": 35,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence1-35",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_A",
      "source_quote": "侯景圍城，堅屯太陽門，終日蒲飲，不撫軍政。",
      "reading": "侯景圍城時，堅領太陽門守備。",
      "note": "侯景圍城時，堅領太陽門守備。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 35,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence1-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_A",
      "source_quote": "吏士有功，未嘗申理，疫癘所加，亦不存卹，士咸憤怨。",
      "reading": "因不處理將士功賞、病疫，吏士怨。",
      "note": "因不處理將士功賞、病疫，吏士怨。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 81,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence1-81",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_A",
      "source_quote": "太清三年三月，堅書佐董勛華、白曇朗等以繩引賊登樓，城遂陷，堅遇害。",
      "reading": "太清三年三月，書佐董勛華、白曇朗引侯景兵入，堅被害。",
      "note": "太清三年三月，書佐董勛華、白曇朗引侯景兵入，堅被害。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 81,
      "end_codepoint": 114,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "弟確，字仲正。",
      "reading": "確為堅弟，字仲正。",
      "note": "確為堅弟，字仲正。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 7,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence2-7",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "少驍勇，有文才。",
      "reading": "有勇力與文才。",
      "note": "有勇力與文才。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 7,
      "end_codepoint": 15,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence2-15",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "大同二年，封爲正階侯，邑五百戶，後徙封永安。",
      "reading": "大同二年先封正階侯，後徙封永安。",
      "note": "大同二年先封正階侯，後徙封永安。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 15,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence2-37",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "常在第中習騎射，學兵法，時人皆以爲狂。",
      "reading": "在家習騎射兵書，時人目為狂。",
      "note": "在家習騎射兵書，時人目為狂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence2-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "左右或以進諫，確曰：「聽吾爲國家破賊，使汝知之。」",
      "reading": "向勸諫者自述立功之志。",
      "note": "向勸諫者自述立功之志。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 81,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence2-81",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "除秘書丞，太子中舍人。",
      "reading": "歷秘書丞、太子中舍人。",
      "note": "歷秘書丞、太子中舍人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 81,
      "end_codepoint": 92,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "鐘山之役，確苦戰，所向披靡，羣虜憚之。",
      "reading": "鍾山一役勇戰。",
      "note": "鍾山一役勇戰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence3-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "確每臨陣對敵，意氣詳贍。",
      "reading": "述臨敵的氣度。",
      "note": "述臨敵的氣度。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence3-31",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "帶甲據鞍，自朝及夕，馳驟往反，不以爲勞，諸將服其壯勇。",
      "reading": "日久馳驟，諸將服其勇。",
      "note": "日久馳驟，諸將服其勇。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 31,
      "end_codepoint": 58,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence3-58",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "及侯景乞盟，確在外，慮爲後患，啓求召確入城。",
      "reading": "侯景求盟，恐仍在城外的確為患，請召之入城。",
      "note": "侯景求盟，恐仍在城外的確為患，請召之入城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 58,
      "end_codepoint": 80,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
