      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "詔乃召確爲南中郎將、廣州刺史，增封二千戶。",
      "reading": "朝廷命為南中郎將、廣州刺史，增邑。",
      "note": "朝廷命為南中郎將、廣州刺史，增邑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 80,
      "end_codepoint": 101,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:received_sentence3-101",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "確知此盟多貳，城必淪沒，因欲南奔。",
      "reading": "確懷疑盟約，欲先南去。",
      "note": "確懷疑盟約，欲先南去。",
