      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "確旣出見景，景愛其膂力，恒令在左右。",
      "reading": "侯景令確常在左右。",
      "note": "侯景令確常在左右。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p004",
