      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "81y_7i5_frc_B",
      "source_quote": "卿還啓家王，願勿以爲念也。」",
      "reading": "確請使者傳報其父。",
      "note": "確請使者傳報其父。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-xiaojian-xiaoque:p004",
